WEBVTT

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:04.520
mogao da nam pomogne
da razumemo misli osobe u komi?

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.456
Nismo još dotle stigli,

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:10.216
ali dobro obratite pažnju.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.936
Stići ćemo uskoro.

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.456
Hvala.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:16.972
(Aplauz)